{"total": 37.352, "voice": "20261124-bisleri-unsafe/voice.wav", "lines": [{"start": 0.25, "text": "Bisleri ka paani unsafe? Bottle phenkne se pehle poora sach suniye.", "end": 3.99}, {"start": 4.34, "text": "FSSAI ne Bisleri pe case chalane ki manzoori di hai.", "end": 7.0}, {"start": 7.0, "text": "Maamla ek purane batch ka hai. Goa plant, pichhle saal September ka.", "end": 10.694}, {"start": 11.077, "text": "Chhe sample liye gaye. Paanch bilkul theek nikle.", "end": 13.026}, {"start": 13.417, "text": "Ek mein bromate mila baarah microgram, jabki limit hai das.", "end": 16.07}, {"start": 16.07, "text": "Phir doosri lab mein bromate limit ke andar nikla, lekin PAH naam ka ek aur chemical flag hua.", "end": 20.684}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "Bisleri kehti hai, unke process mein nabbe se zyada test hote hain, aur woh FSSAI ke saath cooperate karegi.", "end": 26.32}, {"start": 26.32, "text": "Toh aaj ki bottle? Kisi recall ka order nahi aaya, maamla ek batch ka hai. Par case ka faisla abhi baaki hai.", "end": 32.88}, {"start": 32.88, "text": "Aap Bisleri peete rahoge? Haan ya na, comment karo.", "end": 36.032}], "words": [{"w": "Bisleri", "start": 0.25, "end": 0.7}, {"w": "ka", "start": 0.72, "end": 0.88}, {"w": "paani", "start": 0.9, "end": 1.06}, {"w": "unsafe?", "start": 1.08, "end": 1.24}, {"w": "Bottle", "start": 1.26, "end": 1.352}, {"w": "phenkne", "start": 1.372, "end": 1.464}, {"w": "se", "start": 1.484, "end": 1.576}, {"w": "pehle", "start": 1.596, "end": 1.688}, {"w": "poora", "start": 1.708, "end": 1.8}, {"w": "sach", "start": 1.82, "end": 1.912}, {"w": "suniye.", "start": 1.932, "end": 2.024}, {"w": "FSSAI", "start": 2.044, "end": 2.136}, {"w": "ne", "start": 2.156, "end": 2.248}, {"w": "Bisleri", "start": 2.268, "end": 2.36}, {"w": "pe", "start": 2.38, "end": 2.472}, {"w": "case", "start": 2.492, "end": 2.584}, {"w": "chalane", "start": 2.604, "end": 2.696}, {"w": "ki", "start": 2.716, "end": 2.808}, {"w": "manzoori", "start": 2.828, "end": 2.92}, {"w": "d